        "focus": ["windowsDesktop", "activityCapture", "identityResolver", "sessionTracker", "changeBus", "databaseSink", "sqliteStore"],
        "note": "从 Windows 前台活动采集开始，经过身份解析和会话切分，最终可靠写入 SQLite。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lifecyclePath",
        "label": "程序生命周期",
        "focus": ["lifecycleHost", "settingsAndLogs", "sessionTracker", "userInterface"],
        "note": "Host 管理后台追踪；关窗只隐藏到托盘，真正退出时停止追踪并完成落库。"
      },
      {
        "id": "consumerPath",
        "label": "事件消费者",
        "focus": ["sessionTracker", "changeBus", "databaseSink", "userInterface", "presenceBridge"],
        "note": "数据库消费完整有序事件，界面和 Presence 只接收最新状态，彼此互不阻塞。"
      }
    ]
